Package: gnome-shell-extension-orrery
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Fadi Q <fadi.qazzazee@gmail.com>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 48)
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gir1.2-gst-plugins-base-1.0
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fqazzazee/orrery
Description: Live, OLED-black solar system wallpaper for GNOME Shell
 Orrery turns the GNOME desktop into a live solar system: planets in their
 real positions, spinning at their relative speeds, with the spacecraft of
 the space age replaying their gravity-assist journeys. Click anything for
 facts, scrub through history on a timeline, fly in to a planet's moons and
 satellites, or pull back to the Oort cloud.
